        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dana Carvey, Chris Farley, Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, Alice Cooper, Perry Andelin Blake, Harris Goldberg\n- Films: Wayne's World, Wayne's World 2, The Master of Disguise\n- Organizations: Saturday Night Live, NBC, Second City Theatre\n- Roles: Garth Algar\n\nFacts:\n- Dana Thomas Carvey was born on June 2, 1955.\n- Dana Carvey was a cast member of NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1986 to 1993.\n- Chris Farley was a member of Chicago's Second City Theatre before joining NBC's Saturday Night Live.\n- Chris Farley was a cast member of NBC's Saturday Night Live from 1990 to 1995.\n- Chris Farley was known for his loud, energetic comedic style.\n- Wayne's World was released in 1992 and featured Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Brian Doyle-Murray, Chris Farley, Ed O'Neill, Ione Skye, Meat Loaf, and Alice Cooper.\n- Dana Carvey played Garth Algar in Wayne's World in 1992 and in Wayne's World 2 in 1993.\n- The Master of Disguise is a 2002 American comedy adventure film.\n- The Master of Disguise was directed by Perry Andelin Blake in his directorial debut.\n- The Master of Disguise was written by Dana Carvey and Harris Goldberg.",
